sequenceDiagram
    actor HR
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant CS as Cloud Storage (Backblaze B2)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    HR->>FE: Open an APPLIED candidate, read CV, write a review note
    FE->>BE: PATCH /api/candidates/:id {reviewNote}
    BE->>DB: Save Candidate.lastCvReviewNote
    HR->>FE: Click "Shortlist" or "Reject"
    FE->>BE: PATCH /api/applications/:id/status {status: SHORTLISTED | REJECTED}
    BE->>DB: findUnique CandidateApplication by id

    alt application not in APPLIED stage (and not a valid Reconsider case)
        BE-->>FE: 400 error (already decided / not in a decidable stage)
    else valid transition
        BE->>DB: Check vacancy is not ON_HOLD
        BE->>DB: Confirm Candidate.lastCvReviewNote has actually been saved
        alt no saved review note
            BE-->>FE: 400 "Write and save a review note before deciding"
        else note present
            BE->>DB: transitionApplicationStage() -- closes current ApplicationStageHistory entry, opens new one, updates CandidateApplication.stage
            alt status === REJECTED
                BE->>DB: Count this candidate's OTHER applications where stage != REJECTED
                alt candidate has no other active/hired application
                    BE->>CS: renameFile(currentCvKey, "rejected/" + currentCvKey)
                    BE->>DB: Update Candidate.cvUrl to the rejected/ path
                else candidate still active on another vacancy
                    Note over BE,CS: CV left where it is -- still needed by the other active application
                end
            end
            BE-->>FE: 200 updated CandidateApplication
        end
    end
